This repository contains the AGAP-Net core implementation.

The attention computation builds on Agent Attention:
https://www.ecva.net/papers/eccv_2024/papers_ECCV/papers/06652.pdf
The model combines gated values with independently trainable, affect-initialized agents.

The frozen XLS-R-2B encoder is provided separately by Meta:
https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-xls-r-2b
Its model card lists the Apache-2.0 license. Encoder weights are not redistributed here.

Speech corpora and user-generated caches are governed by their respective access conditions.
